const body="Added relay observability and limits in 4a9ff7cb8, for both `mise ssh` and `mise bootstrap remote`:

- `--github-relay-log-requests` and `--github-relay-no-log-requests`
- `--github-relay-log-format text|jsonl`
- `--github-relay-max-duration 1h`
- Global `[settings.github_relay]` preferences for logging, format, maximum duration, total request timeout, and concurrency
